flowchart LR
    U((User moves slider)) --> Ctrl[SliderSettingControl]
    Ctrl -->|onValueChanged| W[SettingDescriptor.Write]
    W -->|repository.SetFloat| Repo[PlayerPrefsSettingsRepository]
    W -->|side effect| Side["bridge.RaiseMaster<br/>or<br/>displayService.SetMouseSensitivity"]
    Repo --> Backend[IPlayerPrefsBackend]
    Backend --> PP[(PlayerPrefs)]
    Side -.->|event| Sub["AudioMixerVolumeApplier<br/>PlayerCamera"]

    Show[SettingsScreen.Show] -->|snapshot for revert| Cat[Iterate ISettingsCategory.Descriptors]
    Cat --> R[SettingDescriptor.Read]
    R -->|repository.GetFloat| Repo

    SaveBtn[user clicks SAVE] -->|repository.Save| Repo
    Repo -->|backend.Save| Backend
